9. O-O b6 {Black's method is very slow.} 10. h3 a6 11. g4 Nd7 12. a4 Rb8 13.
Qe1 Bb7 14. h4 {intending a Pawn sacrifice for an attack on the KS.} Nf6 15. h5
Nxg4 ({If} 15... gxh5 16. g5 Z0 17. Qh4 {is suicidal for Black.}) 16. Qh4 Bc8
17. f5 Ne5 18. Nxe5 Bxe5 19. Bg5 Bf6 20. Bxf6 exf6 21. hxg6 fxg6 22. fxg6 hxg6
