38. Qxb8 Qe7 39. Re1 Qf8 40. Qxb6 Re7 {Adjourned.} 41. Rxe7+ {Sealed move.}
Qxe7 42. Qb7+ Nc7 43. Qc6+ Kd8 44. Qf6 Qxf6 45. Rxf6 Bd7 46. b3 a5 47. Ne4 Ne8
